{
 "command": "settings-builder",
 "notes": [
  "Feeds W8-19c (dialogs::settings::builder::inputs). Reflection over the internal SettingsPageBuilder of PhotoReview.dll; see tools/oracle-cs/Commands/W8-19c.cs for the op vocabulary and the output fields.",
  "Controls declared with a Button class get '&' doubled in the item text and in the stored provider; Static/Edit/ComboBox texts are untouched. A throwing op appends {threw: <exception name>} to results; the exception types are InvalidOperationException (999-control limit) and ArgumentException (radio arguments)."
